  "raw_text_summary": "To automatically transform long YouTube videos into viral TikToks using AI, a specialized workflow leveraging AI-powered video repurposing tools is highly effective. These tools are designed to identify key moments, reformat content for vertical viewing, and add engaging elements like captions, significantly reducing manual editing time.\n\nLeading tools for this creator workflow include:\n\n*   **OpusClip** is frequently cited as a leader for repurposing long-form video into short clips. It automatically splits long videos (such as podcasts, webinars, or YouTube videos) into short clips optimized for TikTok, Reels, and Shorts. Key features include AI clip detection with virality score prediction, animated captions in over 20 languages, AI B-roll generation, and auto-posting capabilities. OpusClip accepts YouTube links or uploaded files and can generate multiple clips from a single long video.\n    *   **Verified URL:** opus.pro\n\n*   **Klap** is an AI video clipping tool that converts long videos into vertical shorts, complete with virality scores, active-speaker reframing, and captions. It uses AI to identify interesting topics, intelligently frame the content, and create responsive subtitles. Klap can convert a 3-minute YouTube video into multiple ready-to-publish videos for TikTok or Instagram.\n    *   **Verified URL:** klap.app\n\n*   **Vizard** offers a YouTube to TikTok converter that automatically resizes videos to the optimal 9:16 aspect ratio for TikTok and adjusts the focus to recenter speakers. It provides robust customization options, including pre-designed templates, background modification, and logo incorporation. Vizard also simplifies adding subtitles and captions.\n    *   **Verified URL:** vizard.ai\n\n*   **WayinVideo** is an AI-powered TikTok content repurposing tool that automatically identifies key moments, adjusts video layouts, tracks subjects, and optimizes content for TikTok's vertical format. It supports uploading existing videos or pasting video links and offers flexible layout options like split-screen and multi-frame styles.\n    *   **Verified URL:** wayinvideo.com\n\n*   **Revid AI** converts YouTube videos into TikTok-ready vertical clips with smart cropping, captions, and optimized pacing. Users paste a YouTube URL, and the AI identifies the strongest moments (up to 3 clips of 10 seconds to 2 minutes), reformats them to 9:16, and adds TikTok-style captions.\n    *   **Verified URL:** revid.ai\n\n*   **SendShort** quickly turns YouTube videos into TikTok-ready content by pulling the best",
